<section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><p class="eyebrow light">Privacy information</p><h1>How contact enquiries are handled.</h1></div></section>
<section class="section-pad"><div class="container prose"><p>When you use the contact form, we collect the name, email address, organisation (if provided) and message you submit. We use that information to review and respond to your enquiry.</p><p>The form sends your message through MailerSend to the business recipients configured for Moss Harper. Please do not include sensitive personal information or confidential documents in an initial enquiry.</p><p>This page is pre-launch information. The final privacy notice, including contact details, retention periods and other required disclosures, needs approval before publication.</p></div></section>
